LVGL - the UI toolkit
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Location      managed_components/lvgl__lvgl/, fetched by the ESP-IDF component
              manager from the Espressif component registry at build time. It is
              pinned in main/idf_component.yml and dependencies.lock rather than
              vendored into this repository, which is how the registry expects a
              component to be consumed.
Version       9.6.0~1 (lvgl/lvgl), the v9 line: v8.4 reached end-of-life in
              March 2025.
Licence       MIT, plus the fonts it bundles. The full text is in the fetched
              component (managed_components/lvgl__lvgl/LICENCE.txt), and the
              bundled Montserrat font is under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
              (LICENCE.txt alongside the font sources).
Modifications none.

LVGL's memory behaviour is part of this project's design rather than a default it
inherited: LV_USE_CUSTOM_MALLOC routes every LVGL allocation through
heap_caps_malloc_prefer(PSRAM first), implemented in main/ui_fit.c, so the UI's
memory never competes with the internal RAM that Wi-Fi's DMA buffers need. See
docs/research/radio-player-memory-and-lvgl.md.

